        "text": "Page: Under the Cherry Moon. Sentence: The film also stars former The Time member Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Kristin Scott Thomas (in her feature film debut), and Francesca Annis.\nPage: Francesca Annis. Sentence: A six-time BAFTA TV Award nominee, she won the 1979 BAFTA TV Award for Best Actress for the ITV serial \"Lillie\".\nPage: 7th Golden Raspberry Awards. Sentence: For the first time, the Razzies had a tie for Worst Picture, between \"Howard the Duck\" and \"Under the Cherry Moon\".",
